<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>No topic page generated</title>
<style>
  :root {
    --bg: #faf9f7; --surface: #ffffff; --ink: #1a1a1a; --ink-soft: #555;
    --ink-faint: #8a8a8a; --line: #e8e5e0; --warn: #b45309; --warn-soft: #fffbeb;
    --sans: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
    --serif: "Iowan Old Style", Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
  }
  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
    :root { --bg: #141414; --surface: #1e1e1e; --ink: #ececec; --ink-soft: #b0b0b0;
            --ink-faint: #7c7c7c; --line: #2c2c2c; --warn: #fbbf24; --warn-soft: #3a2c10; }
  }
  body { margin: 0; background: var(--bg); color: var(--ink); font-family: var(--sans); line-height: 1.6; }
  .wrap { max-width: 640px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 72px 24px; }
  .badge { display: inline-block; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .08em;
           text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--warn); background: var(--warn-soft);
           padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 999px; margin-bottom: 18px; }
  h1 { font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 30px; line-height: 1.2; margin: 0 0 14px; }
  .input-box { background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 10px;
               padding: 14px 18px; font-size: 15px; color: var(--ink-soft); font-style: italic; margin: 20px 0; }
  .reason { font-size: 16px; }
  .hint { margin-top: 26px; padding-top: 18px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
          font-size: 13.5px; color: var(--ink-faint); }
  code { background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 4px; padding: 1px 6px; font-size: 12.5px; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrap">
  <span class="badge">{{ "Input rejected" if status == "rejected" else "Generation failed" }}</span>
  <h1>No topic page was generated</h1>
  <div class="input-box">“{{ sentence }}”</div>
  <p class="reason">{{ message }}</p>
  <div class="hint">
    Generated {{ generated_at }} · The full run trail (searches, fetches, decisions) is in
    <code>data/runs/{{ slug }}/</code>. Provide a single sentence describing a real, current
    or imminent event and run the generator again.
  </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
